  "notes": [
    "Fallout 4 on the next-gen runtime 1.11.240 with F4SE 0.7.9 and the Address Library for F4SE (All in One). The old-gen 1.10.163 runtime is not supported.",
    "Start Minecraft first, then Fallout 4 through f4se_loader.exe and load a save made after Vault 111. They link through shared memory and reconnect if either restarts.",
    "The SIGF app starts the Minecraft side first as its own Prism instance, then the game through its script extender loader (Steam is opened first when it is not running).",
    "The Fabric 26.3 build only; upstream also ships a NeoForge 1.21.1 jar (not packaged here)."
  ]
